<Layout title="Doyeon Yoo | About" styles={["/css/style.css", "/css/about.css"]} current="about">
    <section class="Page">

    <div class="headshot">
      <img src="/images/aboutphoto.webp" alt="Doyeon's headshot">
    </div>  

        <div class="description">

          <h2>Hey there! My name is Doyeon (/doh-yeon/)</h2>
          <p>I'm a UI/UX Storytelling and Designer passionate about creating meaningful and intuitive digital experiences.</p>
          <p>Originally from Korea, I was raised in the DMV area and now call Philadelphia home as I pursue a B.S. in User Experience and Interaction Design at Drexel University.</p>
          <p>My journey into design is driven by my love for blending art with functionality. I believe great design is more than just beautiful—it’s purposeful and empathetic to the people who use it.</p>
          <p>Beyond design, I’m drawn to capturing the beauty in the world through my camera lens. Whether I’m sketching new ideas, dancing, playing chess, or working on a photography project, I’m always exploring new ways to express stories.</p>

        </div>

    </section>


  <!-- some of my favorite things to do are: -pushing the limits of my creativity -sketching out ideas -appreciating beautiful things -->
